    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "****UNDER OFFER***\r\n\r\nWelcome to your dream home at 11 Kilcaragh Lawn, Lixnaw, a stunning 3-bedroom, 3 bath semi-detached residence that perfectly blends modern luxury with exceptional energy efficiency. Boasting an impressive A3 energy rating, this property is equipped with 10 solar panels and a Google Nest thermostat, ensuring low running costs and qualifying you for a lower-rate Green Mortgage.\r\n\r\nStep inside to discover a beautifully maintained, low-maintenance home, or step outside into your private oasis: a South-West facing, fully enclosed rear garden that catches the sun all day long. The outdoor space is designed for entertaining, featuring a set-down patio area, a raised composite decking area, and convenient pedestrian side access. \r\n\r\nThe front of the property offers an open-plan layout with a premium tarmac driveway providing off-street parking for 2 cars. Nestled in a highly sought-after, great village location, this turn-key home offers the perfect balance of community warmth and modern living.  \r\n\r\nViewing is a must - call Dillon Prendiville Auctioneers on 068 21739."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Rooms",
        "SortOrder": 2,
        "Content": "Entrance Porch - 2.3m x 1.3m \r\nTiled floor, over looking front driveway.\r\n\r\nEntrance Hallway - 5.6m x 2.3m \r\nTiled floor, recessed lights, ample storage space under the stairs. \r\n\r\nSitting Room - 4.0m x 3.8m \r\nWood flooring, solid fuel open fireplace on polished granite hearth and wood surround. \r\n\r\nDownstairs wc - 1.7m x 1.4m \r\nTiled floor, half tiled walls, whb, wc, mechanical vent.\r\n\r\nKitchen/Dining - 5.3m x 4.1m \r\nFully fitted kitchen with tiled splash back, tiled flooring, stainless steel sink, electric oven and grill, electric hob with over head extractor, dual aspect and sliding patio doors to tranquil south west facing set down patio and decking area.  \r\n\r\nUtility - 2.5m x 1.7m \r\nFitted units, tiled floor, plumbed for washing machine and dryer, grant oil boiler and rear door access.  \r\n\r\nLanding - 3.1m x 2.4m \r\nStira to attic, built in hotpress.   \r\n\r\nBedroom 1 - 3.9m x 2.8m \r\nEngineered wood flooring, over looking south west facing rear garden. \r\n\r\nBedroom 2 (Master Ensuite) - 4.8m x 3.4m \r\nEngineered wood flooring, east facing capturing the morning sun and overlooking front driveway.\n\nEnsuite - 1.8sqm x 1.8sqm - tiled floor to ceiling with wc, whb with vanity unit, frosted window, Triton T90Si shower and mechanical vent. \n\r\n\r\nFamily bathroom - 3.4m x 1.9m \r\nTiled floor to ceiling, wc, whb, bath with overhead Triton T90si shower, frosted window.  \r\n\r\nBedroom 3 - 3.1m x 2.9m \r\nEngineered wood flooring, over looking south west facing rear garden. \r\n\r\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Built in 2005\r\nCentral village location - a short stroll to shops, primary school, doctors, church and pubs.\r\nA3 rated house fitted with 10 solar panels and 5kw battery.\r\nConcrete floors on first floor.\r\nGoogle Nest Thermostat so you can control the heating from your phone.\r\nOil fired central heating with wall mounted radiators.\r\nMonitored alarm system in place with fob.\r\nDouble Glazed PVC windows.\r\nAll mains services.\r\nTralee is 18km away, Listowel - 12km, Ballybunion - 15km."
      },
      {
